8. Material from public Lean projects (benchmarks)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The challenge files under fastverify/bench/ (bigprojects/, codeprojects/
   and mathapps/) restate theorem statements, with their
   imports, open namespaces and variables, from public Lean projects.
   fastverify/bench/bigprojects/challenges/carleson/Carleson/Defs.lean and the
   sphere-eversion file Immersion.lean under
   fastverify/bench/bigprojects/challenges/sphere/ are copies of upstream
   files (the latter: "Copyright (c) 2024 Michael Rothgang", released under
   Apache 2.0 according to its header). fastverify/bench/bigprojects/mutants/
   contains diffs with excerpts of upstream sources. The upstream repositories
   and commits are listed in the projects.tsv files and READMEs of these
   directories. This material remains under the licenses of its upstream
   projects.

